{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Those who know him like him.","note":"من عرفه، أحبه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Why does he want one of those?","note":"لماذا يريد واحدا؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri doesn't need those people.","note":"زيري ليس بحاجة لؤولائك الناس."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri doesn't know who all those people were.","note":"زيري لا يعلم من أولائك الناس."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri couldn't make out who those people were.","note":"لم يتعرف ياني على أولائك الأشخاص."},{"btype":"example","text":"Those people didn't tell us anything about you.","note":"هؤلاء الناس لم يقولوا لنا شيئا عنك."},{"btype":"example","text":"What happened here?","note":"ما الذي حدث هنا؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Something happened.","note":"حدث شيء ما."},{"btype":"example","text":"What happened to him?","note":"ما الذي حصل له؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"It happened one night.","note":"حدث ذلك ذات ليلة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tell me what happened.","note":"أخبرني ، ما الذي حدث؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"This is what happened.","note":"هذا ما حدث."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Those who know him like him.","ar":"من عرفه، أحبه."},{"t":"Why does he want one of those?","ar":"لماذا يريد واحدا؟"},{"t":"Ziri doesn't need those people.","ar":"زيري ليس بحاجة لؤولائك الناس."},{"t":"Ziri doesn't know who all those people were.","ar":"زيري لا يعلم من أولائك الناس."},{"t":"Ziri couldn't make out who those people were.","ar":"لم يتعرف ياني على أولائك الأشخاص."},{"t":"Those people didn't tell us anything about you.","ar":"هؤلاء الناس لم يقولوا لنا شيئا عنك."},{"t":"What happened here?","ar":"ما الذي حدث هنا؟"},{"t":"Something happened.","ar":"حدث شيء ما."},{"t":"What happened to him?","ar":"ما الذي حصل له؟"},{"t":"It happened one night.","ar":"حدث ذلك ذات ليلة."},{"t":"Tell me what happened.","ar":"أخبرني ، ما الذي حدث؟"},{"t":"This is what happened.","ar":"هذا ما حدث."},{"t":"Has something happened?","ar":"هل حدث أي شيء؟"},{"t":"What happened to Layla?","ar":"ماذا حدث لليلى."},{"t":"They saw what happened.","ar":"رأوا ما حدث."},{"t":"What happened last night?","ar":"ماذا حدث بالأمس؟"},{"t":"Ziri asked what happened.","ar":"سأل زيري عن ما حدث."},{"t":"Do you know what happened?","ar":"هل تعرف ما الذي حصل؟"},{"t":"After that, what happened?","ar":"وبعد ذلك، ماذا حصل؟"},{"t":"Now we know what happened.","ar":"عرفنا الآن ما حدث."},{"t":"Something happened to day.","ar":"حدث شيء اليوم."},{"t":"No one knows what happened.","ar":"لا أحد يعلم ما حدث."},{"t":"I'm not sure how it happened.","ar":"لست متأكدا كيف حدث ذلك."},{"t":"I think that's what happened.","ar":"أظنّ أن هذا ما حدث."},{"t":"That's happened to me before.","ar":"حدث ذلك لي سابقًا."},{"t":"What's happened to the money?","ar":"ماذا حصل بالمال؟"},{"t":"Let's tell him what happened.","ar":"لنخبره بما جرى."},{"t":"That's what I think happened.","ar":"هذا ما أعتقد حدث."},{"t":"That's not what happened here.","ar":"ليس هذا ما حدث هنا."},{"t":"Sami didn't see what happened.","ar":"لم ير سامي ما حدث."}],"focus":[],"difficulty":5}}